    offroad: [
        // Deep snow inside the first switchback: cutting the apex costs speed.
        (from: 14.37, to: 18.141, left: -1.0, right: -0.55),
    ],
    // Issue #107: the sides without wall: the inside of the jump's corner (a drop of 12 m) and the
    // start of the landing (until the flight comes over the road), where the hidden road leaves the
    // road and comes back to it (only where its own road lies beyond: 8 m above the valley), the
    // inside of the snow path's corner (at the foot, on the ground). Everywhere else, walls:
    // around the switchbacks, where the pack bunches up, along the climb and the way down (above a
    // drop: a kart over the edge would fall, or drive on below the road, not seen fallen).
